{"id": "d005-001", "text": "Erin is now completely off gluten. Her doctor confirmed coeliac last month, so no more bringing her those almond croissants.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off gluten", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "doctor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month"}]}
{"id": "d005-002", "text": "Tariq's daughter Zara has her first swimming gala on Saturday. He's more nervous than she is, apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first swimming gala", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
