{"id": "d005-004", "text": "Victor supports Fulham and has had a season ticket for twenty years. He goes with his son every home game and they have the same pie and Bovril at half time, without fail. Do not mention the Brentford game. He's also really into fly fishing, goes up to the Tweed every September with his brother-in-law Graham, and ties all his own flies.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Fulham", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has had a season ticket for twenty years", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pie and Bovril", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Do not mention the Brentford game", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes up to the Tweed every September", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother-in-law", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ties all his own flies", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-005", "text": "Felix and his wife are celebrating their tenth anniversary on June 3rd. They're thinking of going back to Lisbon, where they got engaged.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tenth anniversary", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to Lisbon", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}]}
