{"id": "d005-011", "text": "Long chat with Joe after football. His dad has been in hospital since Sunday with pneumonia and Joe has been driving up to Leicester every evening after work. He sounded exhausted and said his sister Giulia is flying back from Milan on 11/2 to take over for a week. I should drop round some food for him this weekend, maybe that lamb curry he likes, and text him on Monday to see how his dad is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after football"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leicester", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Milan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/2", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food for him", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lamb curry", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "