{"id": "d005-015", "text": "Bethany's birthday is May 14. She's been dropping hints about a new set of watercolour brushes, the sable ones, because she's started painting seriously again since her daughter left for uni. She does landscapes mostly, and she's joined a class on Wednesday nights at the community centre. Her husband apparently got her a slow cooker last year and she has not forgiven him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a new set of watercolour brushes, the sable ones", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "painting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "left for uni", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "landscapes", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "class", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday nights", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "has not forgiven him", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
