{"id": "d005-032", "text": "Remind me to ask Chiara how Theo's first week in Edinburgh went.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Chiara how Theo's first week in Edinburgh went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week in Edinburgh", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "d005-033", "text": "Julia has a big presentation to the board on Thursday and she's terrified. I said I'd text her that morning. Also, she only drinks oat flat whites now, so get that if I'm grabbing coffee before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big presentation to the board", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks oat flat whites", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get that", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-034", "text": "Joe Wright from the allotment grows chillies, about fourteen varieties. He gave me a jar of his scotch bonnet jam.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe Wright", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the allotment", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chillies", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-035", "text": "Giulia doesn't eat pork or shellfish. Keep that in mind for the barbecue next Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork or shellfish", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Keep that in mind", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-036", "text": "Abigail and her husband are expecting their second in February. She has had awful morning sickness, so maybe drop off some ginger biscuits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful morning sickness", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some ginger biscuits", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-037", "text": "I'm hosting book club on Wednesday. We're doing The Remains of the Day.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "book club", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-038", "text": "Kemal's grandad passed away last week. The funeral is Friday in Bursa and Kemal flies out tomorrow. I need to message him before he goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-039", "text": "Sinead just got a place on the master's in archaeology at Galway, starting in September. She's thrilled. Send her congratulations, and maybe a book on Irish hill forts as a present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got a place", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "master's in archaeology at Galway", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her congratulations", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a book on Irish hill forts", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-040", "text": "Theo collects vintage Lego, mostly the space sets from the eighties. His holy grail is the Galaxy Explorer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vintage Lego", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "space sets from the eighties", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "holy grail is the Galaxy Explorer", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-041", "text": "Bethany's little boy, Felix, starts reception next Monday. She is more anxious about it than he is, and has already bought three lunchboxes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reception", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-042", "text": "Phone call with Dev's mum this evening. Dev has been offered a promotion to head of engineering, starting May 1st, but he hasn't decided whether to take it because it means moving to Manchester. His girlfriend Olivia isn't keen. Must remember to call Dev before the weekend, and don't bring it up at Sunil's birthday drinks on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of engineering", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 1st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Manchester", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't keen", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Dev", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday drinks", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "d005-043", "text": "Rahul is the only person I know who genuinely likes durian. He also makes the best dal I have ever eaten, which he says is his nan's recipe and he won't share it. He's a huge chess nerd too, plays online every night and is about 1900 rated. His brother Sunil is apparently even better but refuses to play him anymore after some argument at Diwali.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "durian", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "about 1900 rated", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Diwali"}]}
{"id": "d005-044", "text": "Tomás and Heather are having a joint housewarming on the 15th. Their cat, Pepper, will apparently be hiding under the bed the whole time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Heather", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint housewarming", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, Pepper", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-045", "text": "Kaito Sato is doing the Tokyo marathon on 3/1. He wants to get under four hours this time, after missing it by two minutes last year. He's doing long runs every Sunday and has cut out beer completely until race day, which for Kaito is a huge sacrifice. His wife and both kids are going over with him and they'll stay on for a week afterwards to see her parents in Osaka. I should ask him next month how the training's going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito Sato", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Tokyo marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to get under four hours", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long runs", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut out beer", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until race day"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week afterwards"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-046", "text": "Graham's knee is playing up again, so he's had to stop playing walking football. He's quite down about it. Check in with him on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee is playing up", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "walking football", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite down", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-047", "text": "Eamon passed his test! Fourth time lucky in the end. I should take him out for a pint to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed his test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for a pint to celebrate", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-048", "text": "Long call with Olivia Reyes. Her dad, Dr Reyes, is finally retiring on June 30th, and the family are throwing him a party at the golf club that weekend. Her brother Joseph is flying in from Toronto on the 27th and staying for a fortnight. Olivia wants everyone to chip in for a set of new irons, so remind me to send her forty quid by Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia Reyes", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Reyes", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Toronto", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "set of new irons", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her forty quid", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-049", "text": "Dalia hates coriander. It tastes like soap to her, she says. Learnt this the hard way tonight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates coriander", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}]}
{"id": "d005-050", "text": "Mabel's dog Rolo had his operation yesterday. He's recovering, but she's been up all night with him. Remind me to text her tomorrow evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
